<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The atmosphere, the atmosphere!</l><l>With clouds that fill the troposphere;</l><l>They shield and warm us every year—</l><l>Lord, thank You for the atmosphere!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The atmosphere, the atmosphere!</l><l>The birds can fly; the blooms appear;</l><l>We speak and hear—it’s very clear!</l><l>Lord, thank You for the atmosphere!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The A-T-M-O-S-P-H-E-R-E,</l><l>That spells atmosphere,</l><l>Without it we could not live here!</l><l>Lord, thank You for the atmosphere!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
